direction: down

goals: |md
  **Goals, ranked**
  1. Raise the ceiling — goal-oriented curation
  2. Keep out of the dumb zone
  3. Reduce user frustration
  4. Speed / cost — *guardrail only*
| {
  style.fill: "#eef4ff"
}

gap: |md
  **Parked finding**
  Reducer is goal-blind
  P01 also invalidated cache
| {
  style.fill: "#ffecec"
}

pre: |md
  **Precondition — cheap**
  Peak prompt length down?
  Fewer compactions?
| {
  style.fill: "#f3f3f3"
}

arms: |md
  **Arms, compute-matched**
  OFF · ON · LEAK · TRIVIAL
| {
  style.fill: "#f3f3f3"
}

runs: |md
  **Paired runs**
  Docker verifier
  session kept
| {
  style.fill: "#f3f3f3"
}

primary: |md
  **Primary**
  Success rate × depth
  never pooled
| {
  style.fill: "#eaf7ea"
}

ceiling: |md
  **Ceiling**
  Tasks OFF cannot solve
| {
  style.fill: "#eaf7ea"
}

guard: |md
  **Guardrail**
  Cost per success
  cache-write volume
| {
  style.fill: "#fff8e6"
}

human: |md
  **Human, blind**
  Forced choice A / B
| {
  style.fill: "#eaf7ea"
}

gate: |md
  **Kill gates**
  Success drops → stop
  ON ≈ LEAK → nothing compressed
  ON ≈ TRIVIAL → grader broken
| {
  style.fill: "#ffecec"
}

goals -> gap: explains parking
gap -> pre: branch-point track
pre -> arms: only after a new design
arms -> runs
runs -> primary
runs -> ceiling
runs -> guard
runs -> human
primary -> gate
ceiling -> gate
guard -> gate
human -> gate
